### How to Fix It

Let’s ensure `MongoDBAtlasVectorStore` uses the correct `MongoTemplate` and Atlas connection consistently, and rule out proxy or Spring AI quirks.

#### Step 1: Lock Down `MongoTemplate` Configuration

Explicitly configure `MongoTemplate` to prevent overrides:

```java
@Configuration
@EnableJpaRepositories(basePackages = "com.example.repository")
public class FlowConfig {

    @Value("${spring.data.mongodb.uri}")
    private String mongoUri;

    @Value("${spring.data.mongodb.database}")
    private String mongoDatabase;

    @Bean
    public MongoClient mongoClient() {
        MongoClientSettings settings = MongoClientSettings.builder()
                .applyConnectionString(new ConnectionString(mongoUri))
                .build();
        return MongoClients.create(settings);
    }

    @Bean
    @Primary // Ensure this MongoTemplate is the default
    public MongoTemplate mongoTemplate(MongoClient mongoClient) {
        MongoTemplate template = new MongoTemplate(mongoClient, mongoDatabase);
        System.out.println("MongoTemplate Hosts: " + template.getDb().getMongoClient().getAllAddress());
        return template;
    }

    @Bean(name = "defaultVectorStore")
    public VectorStore defaultVectorStore(MongoTemplate mongoTemplate, EmbeddingModel embeddingModel) {
        System.out.println("Before VectorStore - DB Name: " + mongoTemplate.getDb().getName());
        System.out.println("Before VectorStore - Hosts: " + mongoTemplate.getDb().getMongoClient().getAllAddress());
        VectorStore vectorStore = null;
        try {
            vectorStore = MongoDBAtlasVectorStore.builder()
                    .withMongoTemplate(mongoTemplate)
                    .withEmbeddingModel(embeddingModel)
                    .withCollectionName("default_vector_collection")
                    .build();
            System.out.println("VectorStore Created Successfully");
        } catch (Exception e) {
            System.err.println("VectorStore Creation Failed: " + e.getMessage());
            e.printStackTrace();
        }
        return vectorStore;
    }

    // ... other beans (OpenAI, ChatClient, etc.) ...
}
```

